---
// 4-Altitude Simplest-First Gravity-Well Lead Card for avalanche.openie.dev
---

<section
  id="plain-story"
  aria-labelledby="gw-avalanche-heading"
  class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-8 md:pt-10 pb-4 relative z-10"
>
  <div class="glass-card p-5 sm:p-7 md:p-10 border border-brand-cyan/35 min-w-0">
    <!-- Top Kicker + Quick Audiovisual Pills -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2.5 mb-5">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand-cyan/35 bg-brand-cyan/10 font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.13em] text-brand-cyan font-semibold">
        Start Here &middot; Depth 1 &middot; Plain Story
      </span>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px]">
        <a
          href="/planetary/"
          class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-brand-emerald/35 text-brand-emerald no-underline hover:bg-brand-emerald/10 transition-colors"
        >
          &#9670; Planetary Well (1,315)
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://research.openie.dev/tv/?channel=avalanche"
          class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-brand-amber/35 text-brand-amber no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors"
        >
          &#9654; TV (145 Films)
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://research.openie.dev/radio/?desk=avalanche"
          class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-brand-border text-brand-light no-underline hover:border-brand-cyan/40 transition-colors"
        >
          &#9673; Radio (17 Broadcasts)
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Plain-English Headline -->
    <h2
      id="gw-avalanche-heading"
      class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-[40px] font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight leading-[1.14] mb-5 max-w-4xl"
    >
      Stop bushwhacking off-road on every commute &mdash; <span class="text-brand-cyan">freeze proven AI routes into fast microjoule tracks.</span>
    </h2>

    <!-- Everyday Analogy (Paved Roads & Ice Tracks vs. Off-Road Bushwhacking) -->
    <div class="p-4 md:p-5 rounded-xl border border-brand-cyan/25 bg-brand-cyan/[0.04] mb-6">
      <div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-brand-cyan font-semibold mb-1.5">
        &#128161; Everyday Analogy &middot; Paved Roads &amp; Ice Tracks vs. Off-Road Bushwhacking
      </div>
      <p class="font-body text-sm md:text-base text-brand-light leading-relaxed m-0">
        Crossing an unmapped mountain pass for the first time takes a heavy off-road vehicle burning gallons of fuel. Once thousands of travelers need that exact same crossing, you <strong class="text-brand-white">pave a smooth highway</strong> &mdash; or let meltwater <strong class="text-brand-white">freeze into clean ice tracks</strong> &mdash; so the next trip glides across for a tiny fraction of the energy. Today&rsquo;s AI still bushwhacks off-road from scratch every time a familiar question arrives. Once an AI solves and independently checks a task enough times, the <strong class="text-brand-cyan">9-Rung Avalanche Ratchet</strong> compiles that path downward into fast, tiny deterministic code and hardware lookup tables, with energy recorded in strictly separated classes (<span class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan break-words">measured_j &perp; reported_j &perp; est_j &perp; unmetered</span>).
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3-Beat And · But · Therefore Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-amber/25 bg-brand-amber/[0.03]">
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-brand-amber font-bold mb-1.5">
          And &middot; Trailblazing Needs Search (Rungs 1&ndash;5)
        </div>
        <p class="font-body text-[13.5px] text-brand-slate leading-relaxed m-0">
          Flexible AI search, drafting, and tool loops are essential for scouting unfamiliar problems where no map exists yet.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-cyan/20 bg-brand-cyan/[0.02]">
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-brand-cyan font-bold mb-1.5">
          But &middot; Bushwhacking Repeat Trips Burns Energy
        </div>
        <p class="font-body text-[13.5px] text-brand-slate leading-relaxed m-0">
          Waking giant floating-point models cold on routine, already-solved tasks wastes joules and lets small errors snowball across multi-step handoffs.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-emerald/35 bg-brand-emerald/[0.05]">
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-brand-emerald font-bold mb-1.5">
          Therefore &middot; Ratchet Into Ice Tracks (Rungs 6&ndash;9)
        </div>
        <p class="font-body text-[13.5px] text-brand-light leading-relaxed m-0">
          Gate every candidate answer against an independent check once, then lock proven routines into tiny deterministic code and microjoule circuits.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Depth 2: Visual & Hands-On (<details> + auto-opens at visual/builder/formal) -->
    <details
      data-gw-min-depth="visual"
      class="gw-altitude-details rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-brand-dark/45 mb-3 overflow-hidden"
    >
      <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3 cursor-pointer select-none hover:bg-brand-cyan/[0.04] transition-colors">
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-brand-cyan font-semibold">
            Depth 2 &middot; Visual &amp; Hands-On
          </span>
          <span class="font-body text-xs text-brand-slate ml-2 hidden sm:inline">
            Planetary Digital Well (1,315 Lowering Recipes), 145 Films &amp; 17 Broadcasts
          </span>
        </div>
        <span class="gw-chevron font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan transition-transform shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">&#9662;</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-2 border-t border-brand-border grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
        <a
          href="/planetary/"
          class="p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-brand-border bg-brand-dark/60 no-underline hover:border-brand-cyan/40 transition-colors block min-w-0"
        >
          <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-emerald uppercase">Interactive Observatory</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-brand-white mt-1">Planetary Digital Well (1,315) &rarr;</div>
          <p class="font-body text-xs text-brand-slate mt-1 m-0">
            Explore 1,315 codified tools and 64 developer staples with explicit Stage 4 &rarr; 1 compilation recipes.
          </p>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://research.openie.dev/tv/?channel=avalanche"
          class="p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-brand-border bg-brand-dark/60 no-underline hover:border-brand-amber/40 transition-colors block min-w-0"
        >
          <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-amber uppercase">Research TV &middot; 145 Films</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-brand-white mt-1">Watch Avalanche Films &nearr;</div>
          <p class="font-body text-xs text-brand-slate mt-1 m-0">
            Short visual walkthroughs of evolutionary ratchets, compilation thresholds, and hardware shunt measurements.
          </p>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://research.openie.dev/radio/?desk=avalanche"
          class="p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-brand-border bg-brand-dark/60 no-underline hover:border-brand-cyan/40 transition-colors block min-w-0"
        >
          <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-cyan uppercase">Research Radio &middot; 17 Broadcasts</div>
          <div class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-brand-white mt-1">Listen to 17 Broadcasts &nearr;</div>
          <p class="font-body text-xs text-brand-slate mt-1 m-0">
            Multi-voice audio deep-dives examining biological parallels, AI winters, and falsifiable forecasting rules.
          </p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </details>

    <!-- Depth 3: Builder & Evidence (<details> + auto-opens at builder/formal) -->
    <details
      data-gw-min-depth="builder"
      class="gw-altitude-details rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-brand-dark/45 overflow-hidden"
    >
      <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3 cursor-pointer select-none hover:bg-brand-cyan/[0.04] transition-colors">
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <span class="font-mono text-[10.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-brand-cyan font-semibold">
            Depth 3 &middot; Builder &amp; Evidence
          </span>
          <span class="font-body text-xs text-brand-slate ml-2 hidden sm:inline">
            7 Standalone Apache-2.0 Kits &middot; 29 [G0–G12] Source Sheets &middot; Signed Provenance &middot; Self-Checked
          </span>
        </div>
        <span class="gw-chevron font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan transition-transform shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">&#9662;</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-3 border-t border-brand-border space-y-3">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 p-3 rounded-lg border border-brand-cyan/25 bg-brand-cyan/[0.04]">
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-brand-white font-semibold">
            Signed Provenance &middot; Self-Checked
          </span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-brand-cyan break-words">
            measured_j &perp; reported_j &perp; est_j &perp; unmetered
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a
            href="https://research.openie.dev/replication/"
            class="p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-brand-border bg-brand-dark/60 no-underline hover:border-brand-cyan/40 transition-colors block min-w-0"
          >
            <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-cyan uppercase">Reproduce Locally &middot; Open Source</div>
            <div class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-brand-white mt-1">7 Standalone Apache-2.0 Kits &nearr;</div>
            <p class="font-body text-xs text-brand-slate mt-1 m-0">
              Download zero-dependency replication bundles and verify the self-checking harnesses on your own machine.
            </p>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://research.openie.dev/sourcesheets/"
            class="p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-brand-border bg-brand-dark/60 no-underline hover:border-brand-cyan/40 transition-colors block min-w-0"
          >
            <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-brand-cyan uppercase">Audit Trail &middot; [G0–G12] Gates</div>
            <div class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-brand-white mt-1">29 [G0–G12] Source Sheets &nearr;</div>
            <p class="font-body text-xs text-brand-slate mt-1 m-0">
              Inspect Lean 4 proof manifests, hardware shunt receipts, and SHA-256 digests across all 29 studies.
            </p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
